{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222110","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1522211001:0":{"text":"여러분은 혹시 부관님의 부하신가요?","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1522211001":{"text":"여러분은 혹시 부관님의 부하신가요?","source_cn":"几位大人，你们是副将大人的手下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FF3AFD2B006B90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522211002:0":{"text":"네... 네?","source_cn":"什……什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F9043C8DE6D9833","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522211003:0":{"text":"정식으로 소개하지요. 저희 셋은 마법사 협회에서 보칼리스의 영주님을 만나뵙기 위해서 왔답니다.","source_cn":"请容许我做自我介绍：我们三人是魔法师协会的成员，此次来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC82CA2A48DC8021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522211004:0":{"text":"영주님을 만나뵈러 온 마법사요? 그럼 분명 대단한 분들이겠네요...","source_cn":"魔法师？还能面见领主？那你们一定都是了不起的大人物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3FF738796C48BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522211005:0":{"text":"아무튼... 콜록!\n아무튼 혹시 부관님께 감사하다는 말을 전해주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1522211005":{"text":"아무튼... 콜록!\n아무튼 혹시 부관님께 감사하다는 말을 전해주실 수 있을까요?","source_cn":"总之……咳咳！\\n总之能不能拜托你们，把我的谢意转达给副将大人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F243DC0617F05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522211006:0":{"text":"감사? 그 부관이 날 감옥에 처넣으려고 했다고. 니무, 속으면 안 돼!","source_cn":"谢他？那个副将差点要把我抓走！尼姆，你别被他骗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5233AD9CADD27FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522211007:1":{"text":"콜록, 콜록... 사이먼, 그렇게 말하지 말아요. 부관님도 속은 거니까요.","source_cn":"咳咳咳……西蒙，别这样说。副将大人只是被蒙蔽了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x642909D984E07521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522211008:0":{"text":"이아손 일당이 <style=\"highlight\">매번 구호 식량을 나눠줄 때마다 빼앗으려고 난리치는 거 아시잖아요</style>.","source_cn":"你又不是不认识伊阿宋那群人……<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4177F8DEB3A4EAEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522211009:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">지휘관님이 사람을 보내서 감시하지 않으셨다면</style> 여기 있는 모두가 진작에 굶어 죽었을 거예요...","source_cn":"如果不是<style=highlight>统帅大人常常...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA5DD12D0F3E023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522211010:0":{"text":"그렇다면 오늘 식량을 배급하던 병사도 페르세우스의 친위대인가요?","source_cn":"恕我冒昧，今日发放粮食的士兵也是珀尔修斯派来的亲卫兵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EC900860CD1FFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522211011:1":{"text":"아까 싸움이 벌어졌을 때의 반응은 납득하기 어렵더군요.","source_cn":"适才发生争执时，他们的作为并不能服众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B57802D6675008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522211012:0":{"text":"지휘관은 계속 전선에 나가 있어서, 성 안의 일은 별로 관여하지 않는 듯해.","source_cn":"统帅大人最近好像一直在前线，不怎么插手城内的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9FA972BA8242807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522211013:0":{"text":"그런 상황이 아니었다면 나도 저런 자식이랑 말싸움 안 했어...","source_cn":"要不是这样，我也不想浪费力气和那个无耻的家伙吵架……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3DD34003A7275B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522211014:0":{"text":"다행히... 부관님이 직접 와주셨죠.","source_cn":"幸好……幸好副将大人亲自来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1380529CB22B3E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522211015:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">지휘관님의 부관님이시니 분명 저희를 위해 정의를 실현해주실 거예요</style>. 콜록... 사이먼, 그러니 오해하면 안 돼요.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>他是统帅大人的副将，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A4057EE31BAA883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522211016:0":{"text":"보세요. 아까도 저 사람들이 구호 식량을 받지 못하게 쫓아내셨잖아요? ","source_cn":"你看……他不是把那些人赶走，不让他们领粮食了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF969E915FE5920D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522211017:0":{"text":"하, 나도 안 그랬으면 좋겠어.","source_cn":"唉，我也不希望真是那样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE6A4905F398EB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522211018:0":{"text":"지휘관처럼 좋은 사람이 선별한 부관인데, 분명 나쁜 사람은 아니겠지...","source_cn":"统帅那么好的人，他亲自挑选的副将应该也不是坏人吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13B5D7CA1B0F228D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"부관한테 왜?","source_cn":"干嘛谢他？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD065EB3B5B75BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"부관한테 왜?","female":"부관한테 왜?","variant_male_record_index":"77110","variant_female_record_index":"77111","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"부관이 아까 누구 편 들었는지 못 봤어?","source_cn":"你没看出来他在拉偏架吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3831F87D502E66A2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"부관이 아까 누구 편 들었는지 못 봤어?","female":"부관이 아까 누구 편 들었는지 못 봤어?","variant_male_record_index":"77112","variant_female_record_index":"77113","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"감사 인사는 우리한테 해야지!","source_cn":"你应该感谢我们才对！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x693AF62EDD40B264","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"감사 인사는 우리한테 해야지!","female":"감사 인사는 우리한테 해야지!","variant_male_record_index":"77114","variant_female_record_index":"77115","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"나? 내가 부하라고? 농담이겠지?","source_cn":"我？他的手下？别开玩笑了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50322FAF5A2CAC27","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나? 내가 부하라고? 농담이겠지?","female":"나? 내가 부하라고? 농담이겠지?","variant_male_record_index":"77104","variant_female_record_index":"77105","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"우리는 마법사야!","source_cn":"我们是魔法师！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x435CB1ED88173010","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리는 마법사야!","female":"우리는 마법사야!","var